# The generated JavaScript must survive a clone byte for byte: `verify.py`
# compares the inlined solver against `solver.js` textually, and CI rebuilds the
# palettes and requires the result to be identical to what is committed.
#
# Everything is stored and checked out with LF, on every platform. The generator
# writes LF (`"\n"` in `build_palettes.py`), so a checkout that produced CRLF
# would make a rebuild look like a full-file rewrite — which is exactly the
# failure this file exists to prevent.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Artwork is binary and must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
